+
+## About and team update
+
+About information is adapted from the seven supplied legacy screenshots (033105–033210). Five complete biographies were supplied directly in the conversation, along with the three Advisory Council portraits and Elorm/Rita portraits. Portrait assets are copied unchanged to `public/images/team/`. `Screenshot 2026-10-25 034733.png` supplies the names and roles of Rexford Akrong, Nana Osei Agyekum and Abdul Karim Ibrahim; no further biographies or contact details are inferred. `Screenshot 2026-10-25 034649.png` identifies the Junior Associates group with the existing internship cohort poster. See `docs/about-team-update.md` for route and CMS notes.
+
+### Completed executive and Secretariat profiles
+
+A follow-up supplied full biographies for Rexford Akrong, Nana Osei Agyekum, Abdul Karim Ibrahim, Emmanuel Nuvi Junior and James Kodjie, with five original portrait PNGs (035312, 035407, 035451, 035647 and 035736). These are copied unchanged. The 035531 Secretariat screenshot confirms Emmanuel and James belong in Secretariat, and names Adewumi Adeola Adeoye (Programmes Manager), Daniel Torgbor Obodai (Data Analyst) and Caleb Tettey (Research Analyst). The latter three remain name/role entries pending approved individual portraits and bios. User-supplied contact details are retained only where supplied.
