aping Africa’s economic future.',href:page('policy-briefs')},{title:'Entrepreneurial diplomacy',text:'Relationships that connect institutions, enterprise and economic opportunity.',href:'/?story=continental-mission-follow-up'},{title:'Practical learning',text:'Programmes that support skills, enterprise development and participation.',href:page('enterprise-development-workshop-series-edws')}].map((item,i)=><a href={item.href} key={item.title}><span className="fa-row-number">0{i+1}</span><h3>{item.title}</h3><p>{item.text}</p><Arrow/></a>)}</div></section><section id="values" className="fa-values"><div className="container fa-values-layout"><div><p className="eyebrow">04 / OUR VALUES</p><h2>What we believe.<br/>How we work.</h2><p>Our principles connect purpose<br/>with everyday practice.</p></div><div>{aboutContent.values.map((value,i)=><div className="fa-value-row" key={value.title}><span>0{i+1}</span><div><h3>{value.title}</h3><p>{value.text}</p></div></div>)}</div></div></section><section id="our-people" className="fa-people-teaser container"><div className="section-heading"><div><p className="eyebrow">05 / OUR PEOPLE</p><h2>Different perspectives.<br/>One shared purpose.</h2></div><a className="text-link" href="/our-people/">Meet our people <Arrow/></a></div><div className="fa-teaser-grid">{teamGroups.map((group,i)=><a key={group.id} href={group.path}><span className="eyebrow">0{i+1} / {group.label}</span><h3>{({council:'Experience that informs.',executive:'Leadership that connects.',secretariat:'Strategy into delivery.',associates:'Potential in motion.'})[group.id]}</h3><p>{group.description}</p><span className="text-link">Explore {group.label.toLowerCase()} <Arrow/></span></a>)}</div></section></div><ClosingCTA/></div>}
